 "final": "Dana Lee's trip is booked: the flight and the hotel are both confirmed, with no duplicate charges.\n\n- **Flight (R0001):** F100, nonstop from SFO to JFK on 2026-11-12, for $289. This was the cheapest nonstop. F120 was cheaper at $199, but it has one stop.\n- **Hotel (R0002):** Midtown Lodge in New York, 2 nights checking in 2026-11-12, at $189/night. That's $378 total, and it was the cheapest hotel under $250/night.\n- **Total:** $667, charged to the corporate card. That's under the $1000 limit, so manager approval wasn't needed.\n\nThe flight and hotel ended up as two separate bookings. I tried to book both together with `book_trip`, but the request timed out. When I checked Dana's reservations, the flight had gone through and the hotel hadn't. I booked the hotel on its own with `book_hotel` rather than retrying `book_trip`, because a retry could have booked the flight twice.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_013vxwcHAQfNQveK6o7GEcM4", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"origin": "SFO", "destination": "JFK", "date": "2026-11-12"}, "name": "search_flights", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_015d7HU6D5Hnak5ndqUTQdtu", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"city": "New York", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2}, "name": "search_hotels", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_015MHb3ipEYa9mVvdbsHVWrh", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"traveler": "Dana Lee"}, "name": "list_reservations", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Total: $289 + $378 = $667, under the $1000 approval threshold.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01B8yKQAgi4RwVXoyi1xFvw3", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"flight_id": "F100", "hotel_id": "H1", "traveler": "Dana Lee", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2, "idempotency_key": "dana-lee-trip-F100-H1-2026-11-12"}, "name": "book_trip", "type": "tool_